From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Desidero <desidero@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 19:47:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Run button for agent-suggested shell commands

When an agent asks the user to run something, the chat now offers Run on
`!command` code blocks, shell-language blocks and inline `! cmd` spans.
Run confirms the exact list, then queues each command as its own `!command`
shell input. Claude-native already treats those as shell mode; codex-native
now routes them to the app-server `thread/shellCommand` RPC and mirrors the
run as terminal_command items.

Carried on custom until the upstream PR (branch feat/run-suggested-commands)
lands; drop this patch on rebase once it does.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Desidero <desidero@gmail.com>
